2026-01-03
Fix missing profiling metrics in EXPLAIN ANALYZE JSON output

Some root-level metrics (e.g., query_name) were not finalized in
EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, FORMAT JSON) path.

This change refactors metric finalization into an idempotent step and ensures
it is invoked before serializing EXPLAIN ANALYZE output.


